  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_HEADER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"424\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">提供標準化的盔甲、工具和武器套件，其強度介於原版鐵器與鑽石之間。不會在你的世界生成中新增任何礦石，所有材料皆由原版材料合成。同時也提供特殊工具套裝用於砍伐樹木、3x3採礦和3x3挖掘。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d3271\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"283\"></a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 材料：綠寶石、紅寶石、黑曜石、銅、鋼和紫晶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 原版風格工具：劍、鎬、斧、鏟、鍘刀和弓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 挖掘機 - 一把3x3的鏟子</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 錘子 - 一把3x3的鎬</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 三叉戟 - 結合了斧頭、鏟子和鎬的功能</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 砍樹斧 - 旨在整棵砍倒一棵樹</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 區域採集工具支援原版木材、鐵、金、鑽石和下界合金</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 寶石箭矢 - 更堅固的箭矢，附加額外傷害、穿透力和擊退效果（鑽石、綠寶石、紅寶石和紫晶）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>** 材料和工具數值可在配置檔案中根據您的喜好調整</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/487/906/screen-shot-2022-08-17-at-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"675\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>無新增新礦石，全部使用現有資源製作：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/287/7/screen-shot-2020-04-16-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/287/8/screen-shot-2020-04-16-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>在鍛造臺將普通弓升級為紫晶、銅、綠寶石、黑曜石、紅寶石或鋼鐵製成：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/375/55/screen-shot-2021-06-26-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"456\" height=\"716\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>針對原板材質的額外工具</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/482/387/screen-shot-2022-07-31-at-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"385\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/375/45/screen-shot-2021-06-26-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"641\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/375/42/screen-shot-2021-06-26-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"941\" height=\"404\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/375/44/screen-shot-2021-06-26-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"932\" height=\"208\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/j7bYbkW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></a></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>",
